# ============================================================================
# Notes
# ============================================================================
#
# Files INTENTIONALLY COMMITTED:
# - models/*/config.pbtxt (Triton model configs)
# - models/*/labels.txt (Class labels)
# - benchmarks/*.go (Benchmark source code)
# - benchmarks/build.sh (Build script)
# - CLAUDE.md (Project instructions)
# - ATTRIBUTION.md (License compliance)
# - AUTOMATION.md (Automation guide)
# - README.md (Main documentation)
# - docs/**/*.md (All documentation)
#
# Files to GENERATE LOCALLY:
# - DALI pipelines: python dali/create_dali_letterbox_pipeline.py
# - TensorRT engines: python export/export_models.py
# - PyTorch models: bash export/download_pytorch_models.sh
# - Test images: Add your own to test_images/ (ignored)
#
# ============================================================================

# Go benchmark binaries
benchmarks/ingest_benchmark
benchmarks/ingest_benchmark_batch

# Local, uncommitted working artifacts (exported engines, prototype scratch, gated weights)
artifacts_local/
